<LegalPage title="Code of conduct" description="Expected behaviour at Startup Roof events and in member spaces — pending legal review.">
  <p>Startup Roof spaces — online and at events — should be useful and respectful for everyone. The reviewed code of conduct will set out reporting and enforcement steps. In the meantime we ask members and attendees to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Treat others with respect; harassment and discrimination are not tolerated.</li>
    <li>Be honest about your company, your role and your investment activity.</li>
    <li>Respect confidentiality: don't share information others have restricted.</li>
    <li>Don't use introductions or member data for unsolicited marketing.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To report a concern, use the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
